# Build-time-fetched runtime tools (JRE, MinGit, gh) that
# scripts/fetch-dependencies.mjs downloads, verifies and unpacks here before
# packaging. Never committed: they are large binaries pinned and verified by
# scripts/dependency-manifest.json, not source, and are re-fetched on any
# machine that runs `npm run dist` (or scripts/fetch-dependencies.mjs
# directly). This also covers the dev-mode fallback location
# `src/main/paths.ts`'s `resourcesRoot()` creates on first use.
resources/
